<title>ITALY: CYCLING-KONYSHEV WINS NINTH STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-KONYSHEV WINS NINTH STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</headline>
<dateline>CASTROVILLARI, Italy 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dmitry Konyshev of Russia won the 232 km ninth stage of the Giro d'Italia on Sunday, according to provisional results. </p>
<p>Italian Mariano Piccoli was second and his compatriot Roberto Petito third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Russian Pavel Tonkov retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
